es\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Weighted estimates were derived by following BRFSS recommendations for optional modules\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"using SAS-callable SUDAAN (version 11.0; RTI International) to account for the BRFSS stratified, complex sampling design\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Logistic regression was used to calculate prevalence ratios (PRs) with 95% confidence intervals\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"95% CIs generated using logit transformation in SUDAAN.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Proportions were suppressed where relative standard error ≥30% or n<30.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Model-adjusted, with adults aged 55–80 years who smoked and reported lung cancer screening as the outcome\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}